        <input class="accordion-item-input" type="checkbox" name="properties[voluntary-marketing]">
        <span class="checkbox-consent"></span></label>
      <label class="consent-container accordion-item-hd" style="color: rgb(38, 69, 109, 0.6)"><span>For more information please click here</span>
        <input class="accordion-item-input" type="checkbox" name="accordion">
        <div class="accordion-item-bd">
          <p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal">When subscribing to our news and updates emails, note that Bhakti Event GmbH uses so-called tracking pixels that collect certain personal data (usage data) to enable us to understand how you interact with our news and updates emails so that we can optimise our services to better serve your needs and interests. We do not pass on such data to third parties so that they can use them for their own purposes. Bhakti Event GmbH will only send you news and updates emails with your consent. You can also unsubscribe at any time by clicking on the unsubscribe button at the end of the email. For more information, please see our <a href="https://bhaktimarga.org/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#135DA0">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </label>
    </li>
  </ul>

</div>

  <input type="hidden" id="Consent" name="properties[Consent]">
  <script>
    function fillHidden(hiddenname) {
    var checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('[hidden-data="'+hiddenname+'"]');
    var hiddenfield = document.getElementById(hiddenname);
    hiddenfield.value = ""
    var i;
    for (i = 0; i < checkboxes.length; i++) {
      var x = checkboxes[i];
      if(x.checked){
        if(hiddenfield.value==""){
          hiddenfield.value = x.value;
          }else{
          hiddenfield.value = hiddenfield.value + ", " + x.value;
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

<button type="submit" class="btn btn--gold py-md w-full uppercase relative"
  {% unless product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %} disabled {% endunless %}>
  {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %} Add To Cart {% else %} Sold Out {% endif %}
</button>
</form>